  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "Spec states that if there is no appropriate datetime marker for the requested versioned resource, then server should respond with 406.  [https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#ldprv-get]",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "That should have happened here, but it didn't.  (I can attest that there was a version for the exact date and time in 2018, and the resource was successfully returned, but when I altered the year I didn't get the response I expected.)  See below.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "{{}}",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
