      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I think getting status 400 is correct in this case, which is triggered by the bad day-of-week value in `<tt>Wed, 29 Aug 2017 15:47:50 GMT`</tt>. The correct value should be `Tue{{, 29 Aug 2017 15:47:50 GMT}}`.</p>\n\n<p>I've added PR <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1396\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1396</a> to include the datetime parsing error in the message body that could help user identify the issue.</p>",
     "created": "07/Sep/18 7:17 PM",
     "id": "20181",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12784/comment/20181",
